Title: royal garden

[[rdg
Tone: Drama
Start: A palace gardener catches a disgraced knight burying a crown in the flowerbed.
End: They decide to give the crown to the person least interested in wearing it.
]]

[[character: Fen
Voice: Blunt, unhurried, unimpressed by rank.
Want: Keep the palace soldiers away from the garden.
Obstacle: The knight has left a trail of blood through the roses.
]]

[[character: Sera
Voice: Formal until frightened; painfully literal.
Want: Make sure the prince never finds the crown.
Obstacle: She swore an oath to return it before sunrise.
]]

EXT. ROYAL GARDEN — BEFORE DAWN
